+- Output: A clipping interval $[c_{min}, c_{max}]$ for each color component [S1, unofficial].
 
 **Data Structures:**
-- $c_i$: A vector of color values (e.g., RGB) for the $i$-th sample.
-- $N$: The number of samples in the neighborhood.
-- $\mu$: The sample mean vector.
-- $\sigma$: The sample standard deviation vector.
